---
import {coreweaveValue, cwPresets} from '../../lib/coreweave-valuation';
interface Props { language?: 'ko' | 'en' }
const {language='ko'}=Astro.props;
const ko=language==='ko';
const base=coreweaveValue(cwPresets.base);
---
<section class="cw-lab" data-cw-lab data-language={language} aria-label={ko?'CoreWeave 가치평가 계산기':'CoreWeave valuation calculator'}>
  <p class="kicker">THE ARCHIVE / EQUITY VALUATION LAB</p>
  <h3>{ko?'가정을 바꾸면 주당 가치는 어떻게 달라질까?':'How do assumptions change the value per share?'}</h3>
  <p>{ko?'공시된 백로그에서 시작해 아직 들어오지 않은 대금과 향후 투자, 기존 부채, 미래 사업의 가치를 구분합니다. 모든 가격은 예시입니다.':'Start with disclosed backlog, then separate future collections and investment, existing debt, and value from future business. All outputs are illustrative.'}</p>
  <div class="buttons" role="group" aria-label={ko?'시나리오':'Scenarios'}><button type="button" data-preset="bear">Bear</button><button type="button" data-preset="base" aria-pressed="true">Base</button><button type="button" data-preset="bull">Bull</button></div>
  <div class="results" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="primary"><span>{ko?'가정 기준 주당 가치':'Estimated value per share'}</span><strong data-out="price">${base.fairPrice.toFixed(2)}</strong><small>{ko?'음수 주주가치는 0으로 표시':'Negative equity is shown as zero'}</small></div>
    <div><span>{ko?'기준 종가':'Reference close'}</span><strong>$60.77</strong><small>2026-11-11</small></div>
    <div><span>{ko?'기준 종가 대비':'Against reference close'}</span><strong data-out="upside">{base.gapPercent.toFixed(1)}%</strong><small>{ko?'목표 수익률이 아님':'Not a forecast return'}</small></div>
    <div><span>{ko?'현재가에 필요한 추가 사업가치':'Other net value required'}</span><strong data-out="required">${base.requiredOther.toFixed(2)}B</strong><small>{ko?'재계약·신규계약 등':'Renewals and new business'}</small></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="controls"><h4>{ko?'가정 조정':'Change assumptions'}</h4>
      <label><span>{ko?'백로그 잉여현금흐름 마진':'Backlog unlevered cash margin'} <output data-value="margin">20%</output></span><input name="margin" type="range" min="0" max="40" step="1" value="20" /></label>
      <label><span>{ko?'할인율':'Discount rate'} <output data-value="discount">12%</output></span><input name="discount" type="range" min="8" max="18" step="0.5" value="12" /></label>
      <label><span>{ko?'이미 수취한 백로그 대금 · 가정':'Backlog already collected · assumed'} <output data-value="prepaid">$5.0B</output></span><input name="prepaid" type="range" min="0" max="15" step="0.5" value="5" /></label>
      <label><span>{ko?'신규·재계약 등 순현재가치 · 가정':'Other business net PV · assumed'} <output data-value="otherPv">$60B</output></span><input name="otherPv" type="range" min="0" max="120" step="1" value="60" /></label>
      <label><span>{ko?'가정 주식수':'Assumed shares'} <output data-value="shares">559M</output></span><input name="shares" type="range" min="550" max="700" step="1" value="559" /></label>
    </div>
    <div class="bridge" aria-live="polite"><h4>{ko?'계약에서 주주가치까지':'From backlog to equity'}</h4><dl>
      <div><dt>{ko?'백로그 매출 현재가치':'Backlog revenue PV'}</dt><dd data-out="pvRevenue">${base.pvRevenue.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{ko?'수취분 차감 후 백로그 현금흐름 가치':'Backlog cash flow PV, after prepayments'}</dt><dd data-out="backlog">${base.backlog.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{ko?'신규·재계약 등 순현재가치':'Other business net PV'}</dt><dd data-out="other">$60.00B</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{ko?'순차입금 및 금융리스 차감':'Net debt and finance leases'}</dt><dd>−${base.netDebt.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{ko?'보통주 가치 · 0 하한 전':'Equity value before zero floor'}</dt><dd data-out="equity">${base.rawEquity.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div>
    </dl><p>{ko?'마진에는 해당 계약의 미집행 설비투자·운영비·세금이 포함됩니다. 신규·재계약 가치는 같은 현금흐름을 재차 포함하지 않는 순현재가치로 가정합니다.':'The margin includes remaining contract capex, operating costs and taxes. Other business PV must exclude any cash flows already included in backlog.'}</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="note">{ko?'559백만 주는 3분기 가중평균 기본주식수에 근거한 대용치로 실제 발행·희석주식수가 아닙니다. 할인율 변경 시 ‘신규·재계약 등 순현재가치’는 별도 입력으로 유지됩니다. 전환사채 희석·미지급 자본지출·비지배지분 등은 완전 반영하지 않았습니다. 의견과 수치는 잠정적인 분석가 가정이며 실제 거래 내역이 아닙니다.':'559 million is a proxy based on Q3 weighted-average basic shares, not actual outstanding or diluted shares. Other business PV stays fixed when the discount rate changes. Convertible dilution, capital payables and other claims are not fully modeled. The stance and outputs are preliminary research assumptions, not an executed trade.'}</p>
</section>
<script>
import {coreweaveValue,cwPresets,type CoreWeaveInputs} from '../../lib/coreweave-valuation';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-cw-lab]').forEach(root=>{
  const names=['margin','discount','prepaid','otherPv','shares'] as const;
  const inp=(n:string)=>root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`input[name="${n}"]`)!;
  const out=(n:string,s:string)=>{const e=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-out="${n}"]`);if(e)e.textContent=s;};
  const render=()=>{
    const i={...cwPresets.base,...Object.fromEntries(names.map(n=>[n,Number(inp(n).value)]))} as CoreWeaveInputs;
    const x=coreweaveValue(i);
    names.forEach(n=>{const e=root.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>(`[data-value="${n}"]`);if(e)e.value=n==='margin'||n==='discount'?`${i[n]}%`:n==='shares'?`${i[n]}M`:`$${i[n].toFixed(n==='prepaid'?1:0)}B`;});
    out('price',`$${x.fairPrice.toFixed(2)}`);out('upside',`${x.gapPercent>=0?'+':''}${x.gapPercent.toFixed(1)}%`);out('required',`$${x.requiredOther.toFixed(2)}B`);out('pvRevenue',`$${x.pvRevenue.toFixed(2)}B`);out('backlog',`$${x.backlog.toFixed(2)}B`);out('other',`$${i.otherPv.toFixed(2)}B`);out('equity',`${x.rawEquity<0?'−':''}$${Math.abs(x.rawEquity).toFixed(2)}B`);
  };
  root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input').forEach(e=>e.addEventListener('input',()=>{root.querySelectorAll('button[data-preset]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false'));render();}));
  root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-preset]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const p=cwPresets[b.dataset.preset as keyof typeof cwPresets];names.forEach(n=>inp(n).value=String(p[n]));root.querySelectorAll('button[data-preset]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));render();}));
  render();
});
</script>
<style>
.cw-lab{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;margin:2rem 0;padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,1.8rem);border:1px solid #d0d8e5;border-radius:18px;background:#f5f8fc;color:#24324a;font-family:var(--sans)}.cw-lab *{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0}.kicker{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700;color:#50749a}.cw-lab h3{font-size:1.45rem;margin:.2rem 0}.cw-lab>p{line-height:1.6}.buttons{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin:1rem 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.buttons button{padding:.5rem .9rem;border:1px solid #9db0c6;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#24324a;cursor:pointer}.buttons [aria-pressed=true]{background:#234b70;color:white}.results{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.6rem}.results>div{padding:.8rem;border:1px solid #d0d8e5;border-radius:10px;background:white}.results .primary{background:#234b70;color:#fff}.results span,.results small{display:block;font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.4}.results strong{display:block;font-size:1.4rem;margin:.35rem 0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.8rem;margin-top:1rem}.controls,.bridge{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #d0d8e5;border-radius:10px}.cw-lab h4{margin:0 0 1rem}.controls label{display:block;margin:1rem 0;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.controls label span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem}.controls output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.controls input{width:100%;accent-color:#426f9c}.bridge dl{margin:0}.bridge dl>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e7ee;padding:.55rem 0;font-size:.8rem}.bridge dd{margin:0;font-weight:700;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}.bridge p,.note{font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.55}.note{opacity:.8;margin-bottom:0}@media(max-width:700px){.results{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}:global(html.dark) .cw-lab{background:#1d2632;color:#edf2f9;border-color:#48566b}:global(html.dark) .results>div,:global(html.dark) .controls,:global(html.dark) .bridge{background:#263342;border-color:#48566b}:global(html.dark) .results .primary{background:#244b70}:global(html.dark) .buttons button{background:#263342;color:#edf2f9}:global(html.dark) .buttons [aria-pressed=true]{background:#426f9c}
</style>
